menu "ESP-NOW bench"

    config ESPNOW_BENCH_CHANNEL
        int "Channel"
        range 1 13
        default 6
        help
            Channel the initiator runs on when it joins no network. A board that waits for an initiator
            hops through the channels until one finds it.

    config ESPNOW_BENCH_WINDOW
        int "Frames in flight"
        range 1 8
        default 2
        help
            Frames handed to ESP-NOW before the send callback of the first one came. Espressif recommends
            waiting for each callback, which is 1.

    config ESPNOW_BENCH_STREAM_MS
        int "Throughput test duration (ms)"
        range 500 10000
        default 2000

    config ESPNOW_BENCH_WIFI_SSID
        string "Wi-Fi network for the station test"
        default ""
        help
            With a network set, the initiator joins it before the tests, so they run on the network's
            channel next to a station link, like a probe on Wi-Fi with a dongle. Put real credentials in
            sdkconfig.local (git-ignored).

    config ESPNOW_BENCH_WIFI_PASSWORD
        string "Wi-Fi password"
        default ""

    config ESPNOW_BENCH_BUTTON_GPIO
        int "Start button GPIO"
        range 0 48
        default 0
        help
            Active low, with the internal pull-up. A press makes this board the initiator. The default GPIO0
            is the BOOT button.

endmenu
